                "metadata": {
                    "category": "music",
                    "author": "Songs by Ben Lee Delisle",
                    "description": "Colourblocks is an exciting preschool show that brings colours to life as characters, to help the target audience of 3 to 6-year-olds explore the world through new eyes. As these curious friends explore their colouring book world and discover what they can do, they take children along on their brilliant learning journey.   \n\nThrough colourful, loveable characters, show-stopping songs, humour and adventure, the series delivers colour recognition, colour names, meaning and signifiers, mixing, contrasting colours, shades and all kinds of patterns – and that’s just for starters.",
